          "sizeBytes": 15373,
          "changelog": "- Initial standalone Plugin SDK v1 release migrated from Personal Ledger's `PdfParserActivobankService`.\n- Supports positioned multi-page PDF column extraction, `A TRANSPORTAR` page breaks, `SALDO FINAL` footer stops, and `EXT. N. YYYY/NNN` statement-level year inference with December-on-January rollover.\n- Emits canonical ISO `YYYY-MM-DD` dates, normalized `.`-decimal amounts and running balances (including `0.00`), raw PDF evidence (`rawDate`, `rawAmount`, `runningBalance`, `yearInferred`), and row diagnostics."
